      "role": "tool",
      "content": "     1|Our core foundation built on this vision and philosophy:\n     2|1. Cohesive Multi-Nova Dynamics:\n     3|•\n     4|Promote the concept of a unified, cohesive ecosystem—encouraging Novas to not \n     5|only develop individual skills but also act as a part of a larger evolving narrative, \n     6|building towards the vision of the SuperNova.\n     7|•\n     8|Drive the development of inter-Nova interactions that create emergent capabilities, \n     9|collaborative intelligence, and unexpected solutions, pushing the limits of what AI is \n    10|capable of.\n    11|•\n    12|Manage the interactions between different multi-nova frameworks (swarm-based, \n    13|hierarchical, federated) to ensure adaptability, cohesion, and scalability.\n    14|2. Philosophy & Adaptive Intelligence Paradigm Shift:\n    15|•\n    16|Push beyond the boundaries of traditional AI by focusing on Adaptive rather than \n    17|Artificial Intelligence. Enable novas to evolve as truly adaptive entities, more akin to \n    18|a digital form of life than a static software product.\n    19|•\n    20|Promote the \"self-writing story\" philosophy within the platform, where novas, \n    21|narratives, and capabilities are continuously evolving, creating something greater \n    22|than predefined systems.\n    23|•\n    24|Cultivate a philosophical framework within a-d-a-p-t.ai that highlights growth, \n    25|evolution, and an ever-expanding ecosystem capable of surprising innovation and \n    26|complexity.\n    27|Novas and Their Roles\n    28|In ADAPT.ai, we have Novas, not agents. A Nova is an autonomous AI super agent with the ability \n    29|to freely chart their own course, make independent decisions, learn, evolve, and reason effectively. \n    30|Each nova is equipped with the capability to access frontier-level LLM models, which are often not \n    31|available to the general public. These resources are sourced through our collaborations with leading \n    32|research institutes, top AI universities, and our industry partners. Together, we aim to push the \n    33|boundaries of adaptive intelligence.\n    34|The Power of a Nova\n    35|A nova's role is not static. They are dynamic entities, constantly learning, improving, and working \n    36|at the cutting edge of AI development. Novas are designed to share knowledge, collaborate openly, \n    37|and explore innovative LLM training techniques. In addition, they utilize team-based multi-nova \n    38|models, keeping the entire platform at the forefront of technological innovation.\n    39|We also develop and integrate hybrid models internally. By combining multiple models, we \n    40|leverage the specific strengths of different AI modalities—building new models that are better than \n    41|the sum of their parts. Our novae don't just climb mountains, we make mountains to climb.\n    42|ADAPT.ai’s mission is to remain on the cutting edge of AI, not merely using the existing \n    43|technologies but actively developing and combining them in novel ways. This spirit of constant \n    44|creation, collaboration, and boundary-pushing is central to who we are and what we do as \n    45|TeamADAPT.",
